lower columned wings. Main facade arch/pier dimensions are proportional inferences fitted to the mapped south facade.","The mapped low gallery is represented as an open colonnade beneath its continuous 7 m roof. Repeated column locations and semicircular gallery rhythm are inferred from the plan and visible lateral colonnade; the rear side is not shown by the selected photograph.","The wall plane is set 0.45 m inside the mapped outer ornament envelope to expose engaged columns; foundation, parapet and roof retain the mapped extremities. The palace roof is a flat grey surface enclosed by a shallow stone parapet. Balustrade sculpture, inscriptions, fine capitals and ironwork are omitted. Windows use the standard light-blue palette; no photographic textures are used."],"source":{"url":"/objects/328cdd7e4c82ce82c1265a04bb3e0c0de047b45ee28392aadbb3475a6a69484f/source.blend.gz","bytes":139825,"sha256":"328cdd7e4c82ce82c1265a04bb3e0c0de047b45ee28392aadbb3475a6a69484f"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/6f1386f75d7f9789e59b1dd71887527f1d980a9978178e1a5c3091fc514c99e1/spatial-source.json","bytes":14504,"sha256":"6f1386f75d7f9789e59b1dd71887527f1d980a9978178e1a5c3091fc514c99e1"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/eb1224b97e317eed3305f66789d86126c051a2bebb24088c75e76e10c18795ac/preview.webp","bytes":7562,"sha256":"eb1224b97e317eed3305f66789d86126c051a2bebb24088c75e76e10c18795ac"},"revision":"c1459136dfea5692121a0221f521262fb379d5d6fda37be14b43e04f8e07aece","publicationRevision":"6004851f6ed3868025377c7fdaf69f3f7621d0c6d49c782d04dc8d6c173bb918","bounds":[2.2961409,48.8654291,2.2971819,48.8659831],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"808c7d2073c712316c3ada02d6762b49c869f1e88399736045303c3739e4b7a4","url":"/materials/808c7d2073c712316c3ada02d6762b49c869f1e88399736045303c3739e4b7a4.json"},"metadata":"/assets/palais-galliera/6004851f6ed3868025377c7fdaf69f3f7621d0c6d49c782d04dc8d6c173bb918/asset.json","validation":"/assets/palais-galliera/6004851f6ed3868025377c7fda